            "sid": "DEU 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo no Rwoth owaco ran ni, “Pay telin mapando ario paka marapena, ibin bongan malo wi got, aka tim sanduku ma mbawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alandiko i telin wac m'oyido nitie i marapena, m'iŋinyo, aka ilaketho jo i sanduku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno atimo sanduku gi mbawo ma gasia, apayo telin mapando ario paka marapena, aka aidho malo wi got, gi telin mapando ario i cingan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka Rwoth ondiko i telin wac acel paka i marapena, or apar ma Rwoth oluwo gi win wi got wok i mac i ndelo ma cokirok. Rwoth omiyan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka aloro piny wok wi got, t'aketho i sanduku m'oyido atimo, aka eno jo, paka Rwoth omiyan or.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
