                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " (Joisiraili jowotho wok i Beroth Bene Jakan tundo kiri i Mosera. Kenyo Aron otho, t'iyiko go; aka wode Eliazar olunjo go paka jacway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok kenyo jowotho kiri i Gudgoda, aka wok i Gudgoda kiri i Yotbatha, lowo ma mol gi waŋ pi kweth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
